{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17387","headline":"奉和许阁老霁後慈恩寺杏园看花同用花字口号 · 权德舆","name":"奉和许阁老霁後慈恩寺杏园看花同用花字口号","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杏林微雨霁，灼灼满瑶华。\n左掖期先至，中园景未斜。\n含毫歌白雪，藉草醉流霞。\n独限金闺籍，支颐啜茗花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}